<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27238" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διοπτ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>watch accurately, spy about,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠὲ διοπτεύσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.451
				</span></i>
			; <i>look into,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					307
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho Soph.
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				<u>Fr.</u>
				53
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τί</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.2.10
			</span></i>: c. acc., <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				52.37
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be overlooked</i> by a neighbour, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				5.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>take a sight,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τοῦ μήκους τῆς σύριγγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
					<u>Bel.</u>
					86.7
				</span></i>
			; esp. <i>through the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διόπτρα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Dioptr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
